WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { background-color: rgba(247,241,227,0.92); color:#28241E; font-family:"Lexend","Atkinson Hyperlegible",sans-serif; line-height:1.4; font-size:140%; font-weight:600; }

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.630
This is Calmness.

00:00:04.109 --> 00:00:05.770
A calm space to breathe,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.580
before or during your reading.

00:00:09.054 --> 00:00:10.971
You breathe with the circle:

00:00:11.001 --> 00:00:11.640
in slowly,

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.380
then out, longer and calmer.

00:00:15.795 --> 00:00:16.763
And if you like,

00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:18.453
a calm voice guides you,

00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:19.640
and counts with you.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.167
Take your moment,

00:00:22.197 --> 00:00:24.590
then return to your reading whenever you like.
